    "short_description": "Veolia France is a leading provider of ecological transformation services, operating as a national subsidiary of Veolia Environnement S.A. Headquartered in Aubervilliers, Île-de-France, the company focuses on managing public services related to water, sanitation, waste treatment, and energy efficiency. With a workforce of approximately 215,000 employees, Veolia France plays a crucial role in delivering essential services to millions of users.\n\nThe company operates through three main business activities: water management, waste management and recycling, and energy services. It offers comprehensive solutions, including drinking water production, wastewater treatment, waste collection, and energy production from renewable sources. Veolia also provides advanced technologies for water monitoring, recycling, and energy management, ensuring efficient resource use and sustainability.\n\nVeolia France serves a diverse clientele, including public authorities, industrial sites, and commercial enterprises. Its commitment to promoting a circular economy and sustainability drives its mission to enhance resource management and support community well-being.",
